{
  "format": "ziffr.pack/2",
  "id": "ziffr/fulfilment",
  "name": "Operations and fulfilment",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "summary": "Orders shipped, on-time delivery, backlog, stock, stock-outs, output, defects and downtime, with a weekly dashboard and a Workflow that asks for last week's figures on Monday.",
  "author": {
    "name": "Ziffr"
  },
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
  "ziffr": ">=0.20",
  "audience": {
    "industries": [
      "ecommerce",
      "retail",
      "wholesale",
      "manufacturing",
      "logistics"
    ],
    "functions": [
      "operations"
    ]
  },
  "listing": {
    "homepage": "https://github.com/ziffr/ziffr/tree/main/packs"
  },
  "guide": {
    "whatItsFor": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "For a team that ships or makes things and wants to see every week what went out, whether it arrived on time, what is waiting and how the line is running."
      }
    ],
    "beforeYouStart": [
      {
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          "The week's figures: orders shipped, on-time delivery, backlog, stock value, stock-outs, units produced, defect rate and downtime.",
          "Free room for the Metrics in your Workspace's size: the Set up form says how many it makes and how many fit."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "firstSteps": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Start here"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "numbered": true,
        "items": [
          "Open **Settings**, then **Packs**. Under this Pack, choose **Set up from this Pack**.",
          "Keep the Metrics you want ticked, up to all 8, with the dashboard **Operations weekly** and the Workflow **Monday operations figures**. Tick **Ask me for their values** if you send the figures yourself, then choose **Set up**.",
          "If someone else sends figures, do this right after Set up: open the **Setup Guide** from **Help**, choose **Team**, and under **Who is asked for what** pick the person for each Metric and press **Ask**. It lists your ten newest Metrics.",
          "Send the first figures: answer the request Ziffr sends, or open a Metric you submit and choose **Record a value**.",
          "Open **Dashboards** and then **Operations weekly**. It fills as values come in."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "eachPart": [
      {
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          "**Orders shipped**, **On-time delivery** and **Order backlog**.",
          "**Stock value** and **Stock-outs**.",
          "**Units produced**, **Defect rate** and **Downtime**.",
          "The dashboard **Operations weekly**.",
          "The Workflow **Monday operations figures** asks for last week's figures on Monday and publishes them. A figure that is still missing after its Due Date is raised with the Metric's owner."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "We do not produce anything."
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Leave **Units produced**, **Defect rate** and **Downtime** unticked in Set up. A Slot of the dashboard that suggested one then asks you for another Metric."
      }
    ]
  },
  "contents": {
    "metrics": [
      {
        "key": "orders-shipped",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Orders shipped",
          "description": "Orders handed to the carrier in the week.",
          "category": "Operations",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Operations",
            "Weekly report"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "on-time",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "On-time delivery",
          "description": "The share of orders delivered by the promised date, in the week.",
          "category": "Operations",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "average",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "%",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "percent",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "targetMin": 95,
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Operations",
            "Weekly report"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "backlog",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Order backlog",
          "description": "Orders received and not yet shipped, at the end of the week.",
          "category": "Operations",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "last",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Operations"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "stock-value",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Stock value",
          "description": "The value of stock on hand at the end of the week, at cost.",
          "category": "Operations",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "last",
          "polarity": "target",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Operations"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "stock-outs",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Stock-outs",
          "description": "Products that were out of stock at some point in the week.",
          "category": "Operations",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Operations"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "output",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Units produced",
          "description": "Units made or packed in the week.",
          "category": "Operations",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Operations"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "defect-rate",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Defect rate",
          "description": "Units found defective, as a share of the units produced in the week.",
          "category": "Operations",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "average",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "unit": "%",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "targetMax": 2,
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Operations",
            "Weekly report"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "downtime",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Downtime",
          "description": "Hours that lines or machines stood still when they should have run, in the week.",
          "category": "Operations",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "unit": "hours",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 1,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Operations"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "dashboards": [
      {
        "key": "operations-weekly",
        "template": {
          "format": "ziffr.dashboard-template/1",
          "name": "Operations weekly",
          "description": "What went out, whether it arrived on time, what is waiting, and how the line is running.",
          "slots": [
            {
              "label": "Orders shipped",
              "suggests": "orders-shipped"
            },
            {
              "label": "On-time delivery",
              "suggests": "on-time"
            },
            {
              "label": "Order backlog",
              "suggests": "backlog"
            },
            {
              "label": "Defect rate",
              "suggests": "defect-rate"
            },
            {
              "label": "Units produced",
              "suggests": "output"
            },
            {
              "label": "Downtime",
              "suggests": "downtime"
            }
          ],
          "widgets": [
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                0
              ],
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "gauge",
              "slots": [
                1
              ],
              "x": 3,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                2
              ],
              "x": 6,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "gauge",
              "slots": [
                3
              ],
              "x": 9,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "line",
              "slots": [
                0
              ],
              "x": 0,
              "y": 4,
              "w": 8,
              "h": 6,
              "settings": {
                "window": 12
              }
            },
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                5
              ],
              "x": 8,
              "y": 4,
              "w": 4,
              "h": 6
            },
            {
              "view": "bars",
              "slots": [
                4
              ],
              "x": 0,
              "y": 10,
              "w": 12,
              "h": 6,
              "settings": {
                "window": 12
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "workflows": [
      {
        "key": "monday-operations-figures",
        "template": {
          "format": "ziffr.workflow-template/1",
          "name": "Monday operations figures",
          "description": "Last week's operations figures are asked for on Monday and published.",
          "dueWorkingDays": 1,
          "steps": [
            {
              "type": "remind",
              "daysBefore": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "escalate",
              "to": "owner",
              "daysAfter": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "publish",
              "lock": false
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeds": [
    {
      "template": "google-sheets",
      "fills": [
        "orders-shipped",
        "on-time",
        "backlog",
        "stock-value"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
